<body><div>
<p begin="0:00.000" end="0:03.360"><span begin="0:00.000" end="0:00.420">一</span><span begin="0:00.420" end="0:00.840">天</span><span begin="0:00.840" end="0:01.260"> - </span><span begin="0:01.260" end="0:01.680">队</span><span begin="0:01.680" end="0:02.100">长</span><span begin="0:02.101" end="0:02.521">/</span><span begin="0:02.521" end="0:02.941">鹿</span><span begin="0:02.941" end="0:03.361">晗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yī tiān - duì zhǎng/lù hán</span></p>
<p begin="0:03.361" end="0:06.301"><span begin="0:03.361" end="0:03.781">词</span><span begin="0:03.781" end="0:04.201">：</span><span begin="0:04.201" end="0:04.621">队</span><span begin="0:04.621" end="0:05.041">长</span><span begin="0:05.041" end="0:05.461">YoungCaptain/</span><span begin="0:05.461" end="0:05.881">鹿</span><span begin="0:05.881" end="0:06.301">晗</span></p>
